{"reviewId": "334535621_85UlesFrI", "review": {"abstract": "一个人出生在康波中的时点几乎就注定了其一生的经济轨迹。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "人生会经历三个康波周期，第一个周期没有足够的经济基础和见识，往往错过；最后一个康波往往年老力弛，所以第二个康波就是人生财富积累的快速通道。现在我正在经历人生中的第二个康波。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "1189-1216", "createTime": 1767529183, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "334535621_85UlesFrI", "userVid": 334535621, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 334535621, "name": "NewBorn", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0030-t3LMhR4WSLgyWkkheeH8Jf7/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-100", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 100}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 35, "likes": [{"userVid": 79463984, "name": "LAn。", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/MBaEiaRW4J3zSRruBwK5dmsHIdkx7XWBiaOCyibicBxaPn9O3gfWNNQ5Y7aDYqRYlgaGTjsYMsJDW3aR2ecywxuvnA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "科学脑  人文心", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-200", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 200}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "有时候人生真让人遗憾", "reviewId": "334535621_85UlesFrI", "commentId": "33453